request.description:
GET /v1/admin/tenants/{tenantId}/consumption

Liefert den Verbrauchsreport des Tenants im angegebenen Zeitraum.

Response-Struktur (aus swagger.json):
```
{
  tenantId: uuid,
  filters: { startDate, endDate },
  moduleConsumptionReports: [
    {
      chatCompletionConsumptionReportDto: {
        totalConsumption: { promptTokens, completionTokens, totalTokens },
        dailyConsumptions: [
          { date, promptTokens, completionTokens, totalTokens }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
```
